# A security control, not an optimisation. Without it a bare `COPY . .` sweeps
# .git (full history, including secrets that were committed then "removed"),
# .env files, and cloud credentials into a layer that is then pushed to the
# registry and readable by anyone who can pull the image.
.git
.gitignore
.github/
ci/
k8s/
scripts/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.npmrc
.netrc
.aws/
.kube/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
*.md
renovate.json
